-- StarDict records as index lines: `HEAD TAB OFFSET TAB SIZE` (word NUL, two 32-bit big-endian
-- numbers), a synonym as `FORM TAB #LINE` (word NUL, the 32-bit number of its head, counted from 0)
e-cat : List Word → List Word × List Word → List Word × List Word
e-cat line r = (list-append line (fst r) , snd r)
